ire et critique.0(CaQQLa)201-0377571 6aRoman chinois0(CaQQLa)201-0087355y1644-1912 (Dynastie des Qing)0(CaQQLa)201-0087355xHistoire et critique.0(CaQQLa)201-0377571 6aMédecine chinoise.0(CaQQLa)201-0046420 6aMédecine dans la littérature.0(CaQQLa)201-00463741 6100-01a王莹雪,eauthor.106245-02a明清小说中的中医药书写研究 =bMing-Qing xiaoshuo zhong de Zhongyiyao shuxie yanjiu /c王莹雪著.  6250-03a第1版. 16264-04a成都市 :b四川大學出版社,c2023.  6520-00a本书主要围绕明清小说中有关中医药文化的描写,在厘清明代以前小说中的医者形象的基础上,结合明代小说中医者形象与清代小说中医者形象类型描写,揭示了医者形象的性格内涵,文化内涵,政治意义,社会根源及其文学价值.本书还研究了部分明清时期小说中反映出的当时中医大夫的用药心理,分析了中药描写的文学功能,对比了小说中中医方剂的描述与中国医学典籍中中医方剂的有关记载.  aEast Asia ChinesecCNPIECUS01424024  aC0bSTFffsb590bbea-e4dd-4e88-b066-9f7789edd30ci0040ce12-e03c-43db-926d-325864ad8d7402000cam a2200493 i in0000023139720250403134755.0230112m20229999ii b          000 1 eng    a  2022339642  a1428974014  a9789395073790q(volume 1)  a9395073799  aI-E-2022339642; 25  a(OCoLC)on1358757584  a(OCoLC)1358757584z(OCoLC)1428974014  bLibrary of Congress -- New Delhi Overseas Office  aDLCbengerdacDLCdOCLCOdDKAGEdIG#dUtOrBLW1 aenghmar  alcodeapcc  aa-ii---00aPK2418.P31545bM3713 202204a891.463722231 aPāṭila, Viśvāsa,eauthor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n8510314710aMahāsamrāṭa.lEnglish0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n202324354310aShivaji Mahasamrat /cVishwas Patil ; translated from the Marathi by Nadeem Khan 1aChennai :bEka, an imprint of Westland Books,c2022-  avolumes :bmaps ;c24 cm  atextbtxt2rdacontent  aunmediatedbn2rdamedia  avolumebnc2rdacarrier  aNovel  aTranslation of Mahāsamrāṭa1 aVolume1. The whirlwind  aOn the life and work of Raja Shivaji, 1627-1680, Maratha ruler  aAlso available as an e-book00aShivaji,cRaja,d1627-1680vFiction. 0aHistorical fiction, MarathivTranslations into English. 7aFiction.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf20140263391 aKhan, Nadeem,etranslat