in Ultrasonic Images Using Hilbert Transform Based Feature -- Cataract Diagnosis Using Convolutional Neural Networks Classifiers. A Preliminary Study -- Comparison Between Different Methods of Segmentation in Dental Image Processing -- Assisted Assessment of Visual Stress - Method to Prevent and Reduce the Risk of Visual Function Loss -- Influence of the Conventional and Planar Yagi Uda Antenna on Human Tissues -- Air Quality Monitoring in a Home Using a Low-cost Device Built Around the Arduino Mega 2560 Platform -- BE-AI: A Beaconized Platform with Machine Learning Capabilities -- Ehealth Mobile Application Using Fitbit Smartwatch -- Experimental Research upon Neutralisation with Ozone of Chemical and Microbiological Pollutants from Sewage Wastewater -- Integrating Iot in Educational Engineering Application Development - an Emerging Paradigm0 aOnline resource; title from PDF title page (SpringerLink, viewed January 19, 2024) 0aMedical technologyvCongresses.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2010101288 0aBiomedical engineeringvCongresses.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2007101999 6aTechnologie médicalevCongrès. 6aGénie biomédicalvCongrès. 2aCongress.0http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D016423 7aProceedings (reports)2aat 7aConference papers and proceedings.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026068 7aActes de congrès.2rvmgf1 aVlad, Simona,eeditor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n20101823311 aRoman, Nicolae Marius,eeditor.08cOriginalz3031511190z9783031511196w(OCoLC)1410925438 0aIFMBE proceedings ;vv. 102.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n200718297140zAvailable to Stanford-affiliated users.uhttps://link.springer.com/10.1007/978-3-031-51120-2xWMSySpringerLinkxProvider: SpringerxpurchasedxeLoaderURLxsp4xspon1417723536  aeLoaderRecord xsp4  a92bSTFffi0049c7e9-42f9-48f9-bc8e-54586c17468ds00f71958-da44-4b51-9a1e-7a2620a739b106745nam a2200589 i in0000029120320250403134755.0m     o  d        cr cnu|||unuuu241203s2024    sz a    o     101 0 eng d  a9783031759574q(electronic bk.)  a3031759575q(electronic bk.)  z97830317595677 a10.1007/978-3-031-75957-42doi  aspon1474698689  a(OCoLC)1474698689  aGW5XEbengerdaepncGW5XEdOCLCOdCStdUtOrBLW  aMAIN 4aQ334 7aUYQ2bicssc 7aCOM0040002bisacsh 7aUYQ2thema04a006.3223/eng/202412032 aInternational Conference on Intelligent Computing, Smart Communication and Network Technologiesn(1st :d2023 :cChennai, India)10aIntelligent computing, smart communication and network technologies :bFirst International Conference, ICICSCNT 2023, Chennai, India, May 17-18, 2023, proceedings /cPaulraj Dassan, Sethukarasi Thirumaaran, Neelakandan Subramani, editors30aICICSCNT 2023 1aCham :bSpringer,c[2024] 4c©2024  a1 online resource (xiv, 436 pages) :billustrations (chiefly color)  atextbtxt2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourcebcr2rdacarrier1 aCommunications in computer and information science,x1865-0937 ;v1970  aInternational conference proceedings  aIncludes author index  aThis book constitutes the refereed proceedings of the First International Conference on Intelligent Computing, Smart Communication and Network Technologies, ICICSCNT 2023, held in Chennai, India, during April 26-27, 2023. The 36 full papers included in this book were carefully reviewed and selected from 782 submissions. The main aim of ICICSCNT 2023 is to present the state-of-the-art research innovations and results in the area of intelligent systems and advanced control technologies and real-world applications in ICT research, particularly covering autonomous systems, artificial intelligence, sensing, hardware and software implementation, soft computing, optimization, intelligent control design, intelligent system integration and control applications, and other relevant research areas0 a-- Application of neural nets as computing network in augmenting variables of abrasive machining in polymer composites. -- Design of Metaheuristically Supervised Linear ADRC for a Magnetic Levitation System Control. -- Heart Disease Prediction Using Machine Learning Techniques. -- Mental Health Classifier Model Using Support Vector Machines. -- Enhanced Cloud Virtualization Based On Offloading Dynamic Switching Scheduling Algorithm Using Optimal Time Desk Task Allocation Model. -- A Quick and effective loan eligibility analysis model using LightGBM. -- Lifting Wavelet Transform Based Data Steganography for Health Care and Military Applications. -- To Enhance the Efficiency and Features of Text to Image Generation using Neural Network Models. -- DIABETIC RETINOPATHY IMAGE RECOGNITION USING AI TECHNIQUE IN RASBERRY PI. -- Melanoma Skın Cancer classıfıcatıon usıng Transfer Learnıng. -- EPIDEMIC OUTBREAK PREDICTION USING SIR MODEL. -- Detecting Fake and Genuine facebook Users using Gradient Boosted Trees and Interpretable Machine Learning. -- Multi-Faceted Surveillance Cam Using Computer Vision And Tkinter tool. -- Real Time Sign Language Recognition using Custom Convolutional Neural Network and YOLOv5. -- Modernized Speed Regulation Technique of DC Motor through Arduino. -- Design and Performance analysis of proposed dual channel Redundant LoRaWAN for Industrial Control and Safety Shutdown Systems. -- IoT-Based Crop Recommendation System Using SVM and Decision Tree Algorithm. -- Analysis of Social Engineering Security Challenges and its Emerging Technologies. -- Continuous Sign Language Recognition Using Holistic Key Points. -- New Hybrid Ensemble Learning-Based Malware Detection Technique. -- Computerized Number Plate Detection and Generalized Character Recognition using YOLOv8 Model. -- Design And Creation of an App for Text and Voice Recognition System of Sign Language using Deep Learning Technique - Sign Aloud. -- Malicious cyber attacks on blockchain handled using Machine learning algorithm. -- Efficient Wind Speed Prediction using Machine Learning. -- WAVERIDER - AN AUTONOMOUS SMART BOAT FOR GARBAGE COLLECTION, RESCUE OPERATIONS AND AQUACULTURE. -- Early detection of autism spectrum disorder (ASD)-A Deep Learning Approach. -- Implementing automatic ABCD rule for the classification of benign and malignant skin lesions. -- The behaviour and sentience of Artificial intelligence. -- Detection of Affected Spina Bifida Infant Babies in Ultra-Sound Images using LRMNet. -- Naval Mine Detection and Classification: A Comparative Analysis of Deep Learning and Machine Learning Techniques. -- Netflix Stock Price Prediction using LSTM based RNN. -- Machine Learning Based Earlier Identification of Liver Disease Using Ultrasound Images. -- HYBRID APPROACH FOR BRAIN TUMOR DETECTION AND CLASSIFICATION USING MRI. -- Predictive Diagnosis A Survey: Harnessing the Power of Convolutional Neural Networks for Disease Prognostication through Scanned Image Analysis. -- LEARNING TO GENERATE: TEXT GUIDED VISUAL FEATURE EXTRACTION FOR IMAGE CAPTIONING USING JOINT TWO-PHASE LEARNING MODEL. -- AI-Driven Indoor Farming: An Algorithmic Approach to Sustainable Agriculture0 aOnline resource; title from PDF title page (SpringerLink, viewed December 3, 2024) 0aArtificial intelligencevCongresses.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2007101476 0aComputer networksvCongresses.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh2008101222 6aIntelligence artificiellevCongrès. 7aProceedings (reports)2aat 7aConference papers and proceedings.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026068 7aActes de congrès.2rvmgf1 aDassan, Paulraj,eeditor.1 aThirumaaran, Sethukarasi,eeditor.1 aSubramani, Neelakandan,eeditor. 0aCommunications in computer and information science ;v1970.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no200803779740zAvailable to Stanford-affiliated users.uhttps://link.springer.com/10.1007/978-3-031-75957-4xWMSySpringerLinkxProvider: SpringerxpurchasedxeLoaderURLxsp4xspon147